# Angular Style

- Use **concise file naming** (e.g. `app.ts`, `app.html`) per Angular 2025 style guide.
- Prefer **features/core/shared** folder structure for app code.
- Use **ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush** for presentational components where possible.
- Call **ChangeDetectorRef.markForCheck()** when updating from async/subscription callbacks.
- Keep components focused; extract logic into services or signals.
